FF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Every newly created bead records the SASE agent responsible for it [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]— epic and phase beads carry the agent that proposed the epic plan [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]file, task beads carry the agent (or the human) that created them —[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]and `sase bead show` plus the published bead page render that [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]creator as a link to its `agents` sidecar page.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202607/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]bead_created_by_attribution.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]202607/prompts/bead_created_by_attribution.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-bv[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-bv/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Record an explicit creator in sase-core bead creation and plan[bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]validation[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core: add an optional `created_by` to the Rust bead-create request with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]an explicit request/phase-parent/store-owner resolution order, and add [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the optional system-managed `proposed_by` plan frontmatter field to the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plan validator, schema, and validated wire.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Add the Python attribution resolver and creator plumbing[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]attribution[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]attribution: add the `sase.bead.attribution` module that resolves the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]acting agent's durable global name and a plan's recorded proposer, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]thread `created_by` through the bead mutation facade and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`BeadProject.create`, and surface `proposed_by` on the Python [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]validated-plan dataclass.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Record the creator on every bead creation path[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]wiring[dim] · [dim][/dim]after attribution[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]wiring: stamp `proposed_by` into plan frontmatter at `sase plan [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]propose`, and pass a resolved creator from `sase bead create` and from [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]deterministic epic-from-plan creation so epics, phases, and tasks are [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]attributed correctly.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Render the creator and its agent link in bead detail output[/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]show[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]show: add the `CREATED BY` block to the shared bead detail renderer, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]resolve the hosted agents sidecar URL for `sase bead show`, add [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`created_by_url` to the detail JSON envelope, and refresh the affected [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]golden fixtures and docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Render the creator on published bead pages[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]page[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]page: add a linked `Created by` fact to the hosted bead page identity [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]block using the page renderer's existing agent-link resolver, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]refresh the bead page goldens.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-bv","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-bv.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-cecf56a0c975dddcad668c4cbabf5571","started_at":"2026-07-31T13:13:51.564206+00:00","state":"completed"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.sase-bv","bbugyi200.athena.sase-bv.1","bbugyi200.athena.sase-bv.2","bbugyi200.athena.sase-bv.3","bbugyi200.athena.sase-bv.4","bbugyi200.athena.sase-bv.5","bbugyi200.athena.sase-bv.land"]}
